.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KZTEST-TAIL 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kztest-tail
.Nd follow the log of the lab's current ZFS test run
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr klab 8
writes each test run's whole log to
.Pa /root/klab/ Ns Ar run-id Ns Pa /full.log
and points
.Pa /root/klab/latest
at the newest run.
.Nm
follows that log from its end, across the link moving to a new run, and
waits for one to start when there is none.
Stop it with an interrupt.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print the header comment and exit 0.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /root/klab/latest/full.log
What it follows.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Xr tail 1 Ns 's
own.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tail 1 ,
.Xr klab 8 ,
.Xr kzfs-test 8
